*   $\rho_{water}$ (density of water) $\approx 1 \text{ g/cm}^3$ (in CGS units)
*   $g$ (acceleration due to gravity) $\approx 980 \text{ cm/s}^2$ (in CGS units)
*   $V$ (volume of the ball) $= 500 \text{ cm}^3$

$$F_B = (1 \text{ g/cm}^3) \times (980 \text{ cm/s}^2) \times (500 \text{ cm}^3)$$
